<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Superheroes</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

            /* CSS Background Properties */
            background-color: #101820;
            background-image: url("superhero.jpg");
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            background-size: cover;
        }

        header {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 40px;
        }

        main {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            width: 80%;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        main h2 {
            color: #1d3557;
        }

        .hero {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 25%;
            margin: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #eeeeee;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .bottom-nav {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #e63946;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            margin: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background-color: #ffb703;
            color: black;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>SUPERHEROES</h1>
        <p>Heroes Who Inspire Us</p>
    </header>

    <main>
        <h2>About Superheroes</h2>

        <p>
            Superheroes are fictional characters known for their special
            abilities, courage, and determination. They use their powers
            to protect people and fight against evil.
        </p>

        <h2>Popular Superheroes</h2>

        <div class="hero">
            <h3>Superman</h3>
            <p>The Man of Steel and one of the most iconic superheroes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero">
            <h3>Spider-Man</h3>
            <p>A hero who uses his powers to protect his city.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero">
            <h3>Batman</h3>
            <p>A hero who fights crime using intelligence and technology.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <hr>

    <div class="bottom-nav">
        <!-- Replace # with your actual links -->
        <a href="#" class="button">Marvel</a>
        <a href="#" class="button">DC</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>Created by: Charlie | Activity 3: CSS Background</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
